{"status": 200, "body": {"last_modified": "2024-03-07 09:31:13", "meeting": {"organisation": {"id": 544, "self": "api.notubiz.nl/organisations/544"}, "gremium": {"id": 12761, "self": "api.notubiz.nl/organisations/544/gremia/12761"}, "module_items": [], "parent": null, "documents": [], "folders": [], "id": 1215216, "self": "api.notubiz.nl/events/meetings/1215216", "type": "meeting", "permission_group": "public", "body": "council", "confidential": 0, "announcement": false, "canceled": false, "inactive": false, "creation_date": "2024-03-06 14:14:43", "last_modified": "2024-03-06 14:46:25", "order": null, "live": false, "archive_state": "unarchived", "archive_state_last_modified": null, "allow_subscriptions": false, "subscriptions": [], "url": "https://gemeentebestuur-haarlem.notubiz.nl/vergadering/1215216/Besluitenlijst+BenW", "salutation": null, "template": false, "attributes": [{"id": 1, "reference_model": null, "value": "Besluitenlijst BenW"}, {"id": 50, "reference_model": null, "value": "Stadhuis"}], "plannings": [{"start_date": "2024-03-05 17:00:00", "end_date": null}], "agenda_items": [{"parent": null, "meeting": {"id": 1215216, "self": "api.notubiz.nl/events/meetings/1215216"}, "type_data": {"self": "api.notubiz.nl/agenda_items/agenda_points/8274829", "heading": false, "title_prefix": "1", "attributes": [{"id": 1, "reference_model": null, "preview": false, "value": "Algemene informatie"}, {"id": 3, "reference_model": null, "preview": false, "value": "U vindt hier de besluitenlijst naar aanleiding van de vergadering van het college van Burgemeester en Wethouders van de gemeente Haarlem. Het college publiceert alle openbare besluiten via deze besluitenlijsten. Dit is niet de bekendmaking zoals vermeld in de Algemene wet bestuursrecht. De site die u nu bekijkt is voornamelijk gevuld met informatie van de gemeenteraad van Haarlem. De bovenstaande button 'meedoen' linkt dan ook naar de mogelijkheid om gast te zijn bij de raadsvergaderingen of om op andere manieren met de gemeenteraad van Haarlem te communiceren. "}]}, "documents": [], "agenda_items": [], "module_items": [], "id": 8274829, "type": "agenda_point", "order": 100, "start_offset": null, "end_offset": null, "start_date": null, "end_date": null, "confidential": 0, "permission_group": "public", "last_modified": "2024-03-06 14:46:25"}, {"parent": null, "meeting": {"id": 1215216, "self": "api.notubiz.nl/events/meetings/1215216"}, "type_data": {"self": "api.notubiz.nl/agenda_items/agenda_points/8274830", "heading": false, "title_prefix": "2", "attributes": [{"id": 1, "reference_model": null, "preview": false, "value": "Verlenging Subsidieregeling Groene Daken Haarlem tot en met 2026"}, {"id": 3, "reference_model": null, "preview": false, "value": "<p>Besluit:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>De Subsidieregeling Groene Daken Haarlem 2024-2026 vast te stellen.</li>\n<li>Het subsidieplafond vast te stellen op &euro; 200.000,- per kalenderjaar.</li>\n<li>De Subsidieregeling Groene Daken Haarlem 2024-2026 na vaststelling in werking te laten treden en vanaf dat moment aanvragen mogelijk te maken.</li>\n</ol>"}]}, "agenda_items": [], "module_items": [], "id": 8274830, "type": "agenda_point", "order": 200, "start_offset": null, "end_offset": null, "start_date": null, "end_date": null, "confidential": 0, "permission_group": "public", "last_modified": "2024-03-06 14:46:25", "documents": [{"self": "api.notubiz.nl/document/13888597", "url": "https://api.notubiz.nl/document/13888597/1", "title": "1  Verlenging Subsidieregeling Groene Daken Haarlem tot en met 2026", "description": "", "date": "", "case_code": "", "policy_field": "", "category": "", "id": 13888597, "confidential": 0, "publication_date": "2026-07-23", "last_modified": "2024-03-06 14:15:19", "version": 1, "types": [{"id": 1247, "value": "BenW Nota"}], "versions": [{"type": "file", "mime_type": "application/pdf", "file_name": "1_ Verlenging Subsidieregeling Groene Daken Haarlem tot en met 2026.pdf", "file_size": 707801, "id": 1}], "connections": [{"self": "https://api.notubiz.nl/document/13888597/1/connections/1/8274830", "version": 1, "order": 1, "document_id": 13888597, "connection_type": 1, "connection_id": 8274830}]}, {"self": "api.notubiz.nl/document/13888611", "url": "https://api.notubiz.nl/document/13888611/1", "title": "2  Bijlage 1  Subsidieregeling Groene Daken", "description": "", "date": "", "case_code": "", "policy_field": "", "category": "", "id": 13888611, "confidential": 0, "publication_date": "2026-07-23", "last_modified": "2024-03-06 14:15:29", "version": 1, "types": [{"id": 1, "value": "Document"}], "versions": [{"type": "file", "mime_type": "application/pdf", "file_name": "2_ Bijlage 1_ Subsidieregeling Groene Daken.pdf", "file_size": 566020, "id": 1}], "connections": [{"self": "https://api.notubiz.nl/document/13888611/1/connections/1/8274830", "version": 1, "order": 2, "document_id": 13888611, "connection_type": 1, "connection_id": 8274830}]}]}, {"parent": null, "meeting": {"id": 1215216, "self": "api.notubiz.nl/events/meetings/1215216"}, "type_data": {"self": "api.notubiz.nl/agenda_items/agenda_points/8274835", "heading": false, "title_prefix": "3", "attributes": [{"id": 1, "reference_model": null, "preview": false, "value": "Instemmen definitief ontwerp en kostenraming obs De Zonnewijzer"}, {"id": 3, "reference_model": null, "preview": false, "value": "<p>Besluit:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>In te stemmen met het definitief ontwerp en de kostenraming voor de vervangende nieuwbouw en uitbreiding van basisschool De Zonnewijzer.</li>\n<li>Op grond van artikel 87 van de Gemeentewet geheimhouding op te leggen ten aanzien van de bij dit besluit behorende bijlage 2, kostenraming ter bescherming van bedrijfs- en fabricagegegevens die door natuurlijke personen of rechtspersonen vertrouwelijk aan de overheid zijn meegedeeld, zoals bedoeld in artikel 5.1, eerste lid aanhef en onderdeel c van de Wet open overheid.</li>\n</ol>"}]}, "agenda_items": [], "module_items": [], "id": 8274835, "type": "agenda_poi